@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Request routing
actor "Browser / Git client" as Client
component "Nginx ingress" as Nginx
artifact "frontend/dist" as SPA
component "PHP-FPM socket" as FPM
component "Laravel entry point" as API
Client --> Nginx : HTTPS :443
Nginx --> SPA : static assets and SPA fallback
Nginx --> FPM : /api/* ; /up
Nginx --> FPM : *.git/info/refs and pack RPCs
FPM --> API : backend/public/index.php
note bottom of Nginx : HTTP :80 redirects to HTTPS\nGit transport buffering disabled
note bottom of API : Authentication and repository authorization before Git operations
@enduml
